{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在人物行为转折的因果解释和前后衔接上不如X充分，尤其是念头为什么消退、为什么感到孤独、为什么又想藏起喜欢，部分需要观众自行补全。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的短句和重点加亮让人更容易在听音乐时迅速抓住人物此刻的心思，按乐句出现的感受也能把注意力带到具体音乐变化上，情绪和声音的对应更细腻。X的优势是把人物为什么这样想、为什么这样做交代得更完整，但左侧长句需要持续阅读，容易让观众从听音乐变成读文字；两版的情感发展主线都能成立，整体我更愿意选择Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c5371649-c78a-4a1c-bf26-dcf2f92281ae", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T080449558890Z", "elapsed_seconds": 125.265, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:06:54.836552+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "234edcd6366dcd117d8ba0ddfcad3e9970e6f0d22a9cb8a14fc4351d562a5286", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py